  "title": "BlackSky secures seven-figure, multi-year renewal contract to accelerate automation of future non-Earth imagery services",
  "summary": "Follow-on agreement to explore next-generation payload and software solutions that support real-time speed, scale and reliability of Space Domain Awareness operations HERNDON, Va. (May 28, 2026) — BlackSky Technology Inc. (NYSE: BKSY) was awarded a seven-figure, multi-year contract renewal to accelerate the automation of future non-Earth imagery (NEI) services. This follow-on agreement expands the program’s […]",
